      "text": "# Search Results for \"神经病学 认知障碍 阿尔茨海默 帕金森 学术会议 2026年12月3日 4日 5日\"\n\n## 1. [DAC 2026](https://dementiaconference.mindauthors.com/)\n\n\n\n**URL:** https://dementiaconference.mindauthors.com/\n\n---\n\n## 2. [【日本神経精神医学会】](https://kenkyuukai.m3.com/sp/event/event_detail_society.asp?id=85147&ref=calendar&rurl=/sp/event/event_calendar.asp%3Fp%3D66%26n%3D20%26o%3D%26t%3D1)\n\n【日本神経精神医学会】。【日本神経精神医学会】 第31回日本神経精神医学会学術集会 開催日時 2026年12月4日(金) ~ 2026年12月5日(土) 場 所 神戸商工会議所会館 神商ホール 〒650-8543 兵庫県神戸市中央区港島中町6-1 代表者 山本泰司(神戸大学 大学院医学研究科 病態情報学分野/インクルーシブキャンパス&ヘルスケアセンター 保健管理部門) 単位 未定 領域 開催案内URL https://med-gakkai.jp/jna31/ 事務局 電話番号 TEL: 06-4802-6661 事務局 E-mail jna31@med-gakkai.com\n\n**URL:** https://kenkyuukai.m3.com/sp/event/event_detail_society.asp?id=85147&ref=calendar&rurl=/sp/event/event_calendar.asp%3Fp%3D66%26n%3D20%26o%3D%26t%3D1\n\n---\n\n## 3. [8th Edition of Innovations and State of the Art in](https://alzheimers-dementia.org/)\n\n\n\n**URL:** https://alzheimers-dementia.org/\n\n---\n\n## 4. [Brain Energy Metabolism in Health and Disease](https://natureconferences.streamgo.live/brain-health-energy/agenda)\n\nBrain Energy Metabolism in Health and Disease streamGo。, Switzerland) 11:10 - 11:40 a.m. Molecular alterations of the vasculature-astrocyte interactions in dementia Blanca Diaz Castro (University of Edinburgh, UK) 11:40 - 12:10 p.m. Metabolic maps of the developing mouse brain Joshua Rabinowitz (Princeton University, USA) 12:10 - 12:20 p.m.SHORT TALK Lactate enhances brain resilience in a mouse model of Alzheimer’s disease Imen Belhaj (University of Oslo, Norway) 12:20 - 1:30 p.m.Lunch SESSION IV: Metabolic interactions between the brain and the periphery 1:30 - 2:00 p.m. Well-aging and the tanycytic control of health Vincent Prevot (INSERM Lille, France) 2:00 - 2:30 p.m. Brain nutrient sensing in metabolism regulation Sabrina Diano (Columbia University, USA) 2:30 - 3:00 p.m. Central regulation of energy and glucose homeostasis by brain-derived neurotrophic factor Maribel Rios (Tufts University, USA) 3:00 - 3:10 p.m.SHORT TALK The passage of glucose uptake from the blood to the brain: answering a long-standing question with short-lived fluorescence Rachel Meister (University of Zurich, Switzerland) 3:10 - 3:40 p.m.Coffee Break 3:40 - 4:10 p.m. Hypothalamic astrocytes play a key role in body-brain metabolic interactions Cristina García-Cáceres (Helmholtz Munich, Germany) 4:10 - 4:40 p.m. Mitochondrial function in dopaminergic neurons and microglia Navdeep Chandel (Northwestern, USA) 4:40 - 5:10 p.m. Lactate shuttles and body carbohydrate carbon flow George Brooks (University of California, Berkeley, USA) 5:10 - 6:10 p.m.Poster Session 6:10 p.m.Gala Dinner DAY 3: Friday, December 5 SESSION V: Emerging technologies 2:00 – 2:30 p.m. A mitochondrial energy vent L. Felipe Barros (CECs & San Sebastián University, Chile) 2:30 – 3:00 p.m. Visualizing pentose phosphate pathway dynamics using genetically encoded fluorescent indicators Alejandro S. Martín (San Sebastián University, Chile) 3:00 - 3:30 p.m. Human brain metabolism in relation to asymptomatic Alzheimer disease and cerebral small vessel disease Manu Goyal (WashU, USA) 3:30 - 4:00 p.m.General Discussion & Closing Remarks Times are displayed in GMT Available On Demand Confirmed Speakers Aiman Saab University of Zürich, Switzerland Aiman Saab is an SNSF Eccellenza Professor at the University of Zurich, investigating neuron–glia interactions, axon–glia communication, and metabolic resilience in the nervous system.\n\n**URL:** https://natureconferences.streamgo.live/brain-health-energy/agenda\n\n---\n\n## 5. [2027年美国/欧洲/国际/神经内科会议/神经外科会议/脑卒中会议/中风会议/疼痛医学/年会/大会/论坛/学术会议通知 - 领域国际医学会议网](https://lingyuint.com/fenlei/yixuehuiyi11.html)\n\n2027年美国/欧洲/国际/神经内科会议/神经外科会议/脑卒中会议/中风会议/疼痛医学/年会/大会/论坛/学术会议通知 - 领域国际医学会议网 领域国际医学会议网。会议名称 会议时间 2026年第20届欧洲头痛大会(EHC2026/EHF) 德国 柏林 神经学 2026.12.09 2026年美国癫痫学会年会(AES2026) 美国 丹佛 神经学 2026.12.04 2026年美国斯科茨代尔头痛研讨会 美国 斯科茨代尔 神经学 2026.12.03 2026年第44届澳大利亚神经科学学会科