    "output": {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Search Results for \"第三届小胶质细胞生理与病理功能专题国际研讨会 2026年12月5日 6日 深圳\"\n\n## 1. [会议通知第三届小胶质细胞生理与病理功能专题国际研讨会](http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI0NTIyMzI1OQ==&mid=2247520902&idx=4&sn=002aeda8db24ac1f5f5c5cc6996f55fa&chksm=e8a913af84e9614f8617df0b21b2914436793a44112658178efafae6b97964e4b7145444f34e#rd)\n\n总览Overview小胶质细胞作为中枢神经系统的固有免疫细胞,在脑发育、稳态维持及神经系统疾病发生中的作用日益受到关注。在前两届成功举办的基础上,“小胶质细胞生理与病理功能”专题国际研讨会已成为汇聚国内外专家学者、推动该领域学术交流与国际合作的重要平台。第三届“小胶质细胞生理与病理功能”专题研讨会将于2026年12月5—6日在深圳理工大学天璇楼召开,本届会议由深圳理工大学Bio-X国际研究院、中国科学院深圳先进技术研究院脑认知与脑疾病研究所联合主办,深圳市脑科学学会承办,中国神经科学学会神经胶质细胞分会协办。届时,国内外相关领域专家学者将再次齐聚,通过学术报告与墙报展示交流前沿研究成果,进一步拓展学术视野,推动小胶质细胞领域的研究合作、基础与临床研究结合及研究成果的转化应用。Microglia, the innate immune cells of the central nervous system, are increasingly recognized for their roles in development, homeostasis, and diseases of the brain. Building on the success of the first two symposia, the International Symposium on the Physiological and Pathological Functions of Microglia has become a key platform for international academic exchange and i collaboration. The 3rd Symposium will take place on December 5–6, 2026, at Tianxuan Building, Shenzhen University of Advanced Technology. It is jointly organized by the Bio-X International Institute of Shenzhen University of Advanced Technology and the Brain Cognition and Brain Disease Institute, SIAT, CAS,co-organized by the Glial Cell Branch of the Chinese Neuroscience Society, and hosted by the Shenzhen Brain Science Society. The meeting will bring together experts and scholars from China and abroad for academic presentations and poster sessions, fostering the exchange of cutting-edge findings, broader academic perspectives, and closer collaboration across basic, clinical, and translational microglia research.欢迎全国各高等院校、医院、研究机构和企业的教师、临床医护工作者、科技工作者及各类研究生积极参加。Teachers, clinicians, researchers and graduate students from universities, hospitals, research institutes and enterprises are warmly invited to participate.01组织机构 Organizers主办 Organizers:深圳理工大学Bio-X国际研究院 Bio-X International Institute, Shenzhen University of Advanced Technology (SUAT)中国科学院深圳先进院脑认知与脑疾病研究所Brain Cognition and Brain Disease Institute (BCBDI), Shenzhen Institutes of Advanced Technology (SIAT), Chinese Academy of Sciences协办 Co-organizers:中国神经科学学会神经胶质细胞分会 Neuroglia Subsociety of the Chinese Neuroscience Society承办 Host:深圳市脑科学学会 Shenzhen Society for Neuroscience02组织委员会 Organizing Committee大会主席 Conference ChairsHelmut Kettenmann(深圳理工大学 Shenzhen University of Advanced Technology)李汉杰 Hanjie Li(中国科学院深圳先进技术研究院 Shenzhen Institutes of Advanced Technology, CAS)03会议信息 Conference information会议时间和地点  Time and Venue时间 Time:2026年12月5日(周六)—6日(周日)December 5 (Saturday) – 6 (Sunday), 2026地点 Venue:深圳理工大学天璇楼,广东省深圳市光明区 Tianxuan Building, Shenzhen University of Advanced Technology (SUAT), Guangming District, Shenzhen, Guangdong, China04会议日程 Meeting Schedule12月4日(周五)December 4 (Friday)报到Registration12月5日(周六)December 5 (Saturday)全天会议09:00–18:00Full-day meeting12月6日(周日)December 6 (Sunday)半天会议09:00-12:15Morning half-day meeting详细日程见后续通知。Detailed program will be announced in subsequent notices.05会议嘉宾 Invited SpeakersAlphabetical by surname• Blurton-Jones, Mathew Mark(University of California, Irvine, USA)• Chen, Xiaofen 陈小芬(Xiamen University, Xiamen)• Gao, Zhihua 高志华(Zhejiang University, Hangzhou)• Huang, Yimin 黄逸民(Tongji Hospital, Tongji Medical College, Huazhong University of Science and Technology, Wuhan)• Li, Hanjie 李汉杰(Shenzhen Institutes of Advanced Technology, CAS,Shenzhen)• Nave, Klaus(Max Planck Institute for Multidisciplinary Sciences, Göttingen, Germany)• Noda, Mami(Kyushu University, Fukuoka, Japan)• Paolicelli, Rosa Chiara(University of Lausanne, Dorigny,Switzerland)• Piao, Xianhua(University of California, San Francisco, USA)• Semtner, Marcus(Max Delbrück Center for Molecular Medicine, Berlin, Germany)• Shi, Peng 史鹏(Zhejiang University,Hangzhou)• Shi, Yang 石杨(Chinese Institute for Brain Research, Beijing)• Wu, Zhaofa 武照伐(Institute of Genetics and Developmental Biology, CAS,Beijing)• Xiang, Xianyuan 项贤媛(Shenzhen University of Advanced Technology,Shenzhen)• Yi, Chenju 易陈菊(The Seventh Affiliated Hospital, Sun Yat-sen University, Shenzhen)• Zeng, Yuting 曾渝婷(Shenzhen Institutes of Advanced Technology, CAS,Shenzhen)嘉宾名单以最终日程为准The speaker list is subject to the final program.06摘要提交 Poster Abstract Submission为给参会者提供充分交流最新研究成果的机会,本次会议将设置墙报展示环节。To provide participants with ample opportunities to exchange the latest research findings, this conference will feature a poster session.1)参与方式:请在注册系统提交摘要。How to participate: submit your abstract via the registration system.2)投稿要求:摘要应论点明确、叙述清楚、文字精炼,限500字以内(含题目、作者及单位),英文撰写,文责自负;采用Word格式、单倍行距、12号字、Times New Roman字体;Submission Requirements: Abstracts should be clear, concise and limited to 500 words (including title, authors, and affiliations), submitted in English; authors are responsible for the content. Use Word format, single spacing, 12-point font, Times New Roman.3)摘要投稿截止日期:2026.12.01 Submission deadline: 2026.12.01.4)墙报规格:宽80cm × 高120cm。Poster size: 80 cm (W) × 120 cm (H).07注册费用 Registration Fees在校学生Students300元/人CNY 300 per person非学生参会人员Non-student participants500元/人 CNY 500 per person费用含会务费及餐费;差旅与住宿自理。现场注册须出示有效学生证;博士后、住院医师、实验室技师不按学生身份计收。The fee covers conference administration and meals; travel and accommodation are at participants’ own expense. Valid student identification must be shown on site; postdocs, residents and laboratory technicians are not eligible for the student rate.扫描注册:会议信息请见会议页面:▼扫码关注公众号回复“M”报名Scan the QR code Reply \"M\" to sign up联系方式:会议秘书处 Secretariat:王一涵 Yihan Wang,wangyh@suat-sz.edu.cn注册报名 Register 徐雅晴 Yaqing Xu 15532451447 ,szbrain@siat.ac.cn08会议住宿与交通 Accommodation and Transportation住宿安排 Accommodation本次会议不统一安排住宿(除受邀参会嘉宾),参会代表请自行联系附近酒店。The conference will not arrange accommodation for attendees (except for invited speakers); participants are advised to contact nearby hotels on their own.交通指引 Transportation:✈️:深圳宝安国际机场:乘地铁11号线(松岗方向)→ 换乘6号线(光明方向)→ 6号线支线至深圳理工大学站。Shenzhen Bao’an International Airport: Metro Line 11 (towards Songgang) → Line 6 (towards Guangming) → Line 6 Branch to Shenzhen Institute of Technology Station.🚄:光明城高铁站:乘6号线支线直达深圳理工大学站。Guangmingcheng High-Speed Railway Station: Line 6 Branch directly to Shenzhen Institute of Technology Station.🚄:深圳北站:乘6号线至光明站 → 换乘6号线支线至深圳理工\n\n**URL:** http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI0NTIyMzI1OQ==&mid=2247520902&idx=4&sn=002aeda8db24ac1f5f5c5cc6996f55fa&chksm=e8a913af84e9614f8617df0b21b2914436793a44112658178efafae6b97964e4b7145444f34e#rd\n\n---\n\n## 2. [会议通知第三届小胶质细胞生理与病理功能专题国际研讨会](http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg2OTg5Mzk5Mg==&mid=2247511194&idx=1&sn=86ee318816d97afc37775a66bbd60585&chksm=cf0e5d92c128610273f2738ff4fde46fb7dec9a02ab7aeaabdcc732cea64bdb6303155b1c099#rd)\n\n总览Overview小胶质细胞作为中枢神经系统的固有免疫细胞,在脑发育、稳态维持及神经系统疾病发生中的作用日益受到关注。在前两届成功举办的基础上,“小胶质细胞生理与病理功能”专题国际研讨会已成为汇聚国内外专家学者、推动该领域学术交流与国际合作的重要平台。第三届“小胶质细胞生理与病理功能”专题研讨会将于2026年12月5—6日在深圳理工大学天璇楼召开,本届会议由深圳理工大学Bio-X国际研究院、中国科学院深圳先进技术研究院脑认知与脑疾病研究所联合主办,深圳市脑科学学会承办,中国神经科学学会神经胶质细胞分会协办。届时,国内外相关领域专家学者将再次齐聚,通过学术报告与墙报展示交流前沿研究成果,进一步拓展学术视野,推动小胶质细胞领域的研究合作、基础与临床研究结合及研究成果的转化应用。Microglia, the innate immune cells of the central nervous system, are increasingly recognized for their roles in brain development, homeostasis, and neurological disease. Building on the success of its first two editions, International Symposium on the Role of Microglia in Health and Disease has become a key platform for academic exchange and international collaboration in the field. The 3rd International Symposium on the Role of Microglia in Health and Disease will take place on December 5–6, 2026, at Tianxuan Building, Shenzhen University of Advanced Technology. It is jointly hosted by the Bio-X International Institute of Shenzhen University of Advanced Technology and Brian Cognition and Brain Disease institute, and organized by Shenzhen Brain Science Society, and co-organized by the Glial Cell Branch of the Chinese Neuroscience Society. The meeting will bring together experts and scholars from China and abroad for academic presentations and poster sessions, fostering the exchange of cutting-edge findings, broader academic perspectives, and closer collaboration across basic, clinical, and translational microglia research.欢迎全国各高等院校、医院、研究机构和企业的教师、临床医护工作者、科技工作者及各类研究生积极参加。Teachers, clinicians, researchers and graduate students from universities, hospitals, research institutes and enterprises are warmly invited to participate.01组织机构 Organizers主办 Host:深圳理工大学Bio-X国际研究院 Bio-X International Institute, Shenzhen University of Advanced Technology (SUAT)中国科学院深圳先进技术研究院脑认知与脑疾病研究所 Brain Cognition and Brain Disease Institute (BCBDI), Shenzhen Institutes Advanced Technology (SIAT), Chinese Academy of Sciences承办 Organizers:深圳市脑科学学会 Shenzhen Society for Neuroscience协办 Co-organizers:中国神经科学学会神经胶质细胞分会 Neuroglia Subsociety of the Chinese Neuroscience Society02组织委员会 Organizing Committee大会主席 Conference ChairsHelmut Kettenmann(深圳理工大学 Shenzhen University of Advanced Technology)李汉杰 Hanjie Li(中国科学院深圳先进技术研究院 Shenzhen Institute of Advanced Technology, CAS)03会议信息 Conference information会议时间和地点  Time and Venue时间 Time:2026年12月5日(周六)—6日(周日)December 5 (Saturday) – 6 (Sunday), 2026地点 Venue:深圳理工大学天璇楼,广东省深圳市光明区 Tianxuan Building, Shenzhen University of Advanced Technology (SUAT), Guangming District, Shenzhen, Guangdong, China04会议日程 Meeting Schedule12月4日(周五)December 4 (Friday)报到Registration12月5日(周六)December 5 (Saturday)全天会议09:00–18:00Full-day meeting12月6日(周日)December 6 (Sunday)上午半天会议09:00–12:15 Morning half-day meeting详细日程见后续通知。Detailed program will be announced in subsequent notices.05会议嘉宾 Invited SpeakersAlphabetical by surnameBlurton-Jones, Mathew Mark(University of California, Irvine)Chen, Xiaofen 陈小芬(Xiamen University)Gao, Zhihua 高志华(Zhejiang University)Huang, Yimin 黄逸民(Tongji Hospital, Tongji Medical College, Huazhong University of Science and Technology)Li, Hanjie 李汉杰(Shenzhen Institutes of Advanced Technology, CAS)Nave, Klaus(Max Planck Institute for Multidisciplinary Science