sium will take place on December 5–6, 2026, at MERAK Building, Shenzhen University of Advanced Technology. It is jointly hosted by the Bio-X International Institute of Shenzhen University of Advanced Technology and the Brain Cognition and Brain Disease Institute, Shenzhen Institutes of Advanced Technology, Chinese Academy of Sciences, and hosted by theShenzhen Brain Science Society, and co-organized by the Glial Cell Branch of the Chinese Neuroscience Society. The meeting will bring together experts and scholars from China and abroad for academic presentations and poster sessions, fostering the exchange of cutting-edge findings, broader academic perspectives, and closer collaboration across basic, clinical, and translational microglia research.Teachers, clinicians, researchers and graduate students from universities, hospitals, research institutes and enterprises are warmly invited to participate.参会通知:参会通知-第三届小胶质细胞生理与病理功能专题国际研讨会.pdf。(点击下方链接下载参会通知)🔗Notification for Participation in the 3rd International Symposium on the Role of Microglia in Health and Disease01组织机构 Organization主办 Organizer:深圳理工大学Bio-X国际研究院 Bio-X International Institute, Shenzhen University of Advanced Technology (SUAT)中国科学院深圳先进技术研究院脑认知与脑疾病研究所 BrainCognition and Brain Disease Institute (BCBDI), Shenzhen Institute of Advanced Technology (SIAT), Chinese Academy of Sciences承办 Host:深圳市脑科学学会 Shenzhen Society for Neuroscience协办 Co-organizer:中国神经科学学会神经胶质细胞分会 Neuroglia Subsociety of the Chinese Neuroscience Society02组织委员会 Organizing Committee大会主席 Conference ChairsHelmut Kettenmann(深圳理工大学 Shenzhen University of Advanced Technology)李汉杰 Hanjie Li(中国科学院深圳先进技术研究院 Shenzhen Institute of Advanced Technology, CAS)03会议信息 Conference information会议时间和地点  Time and Venue报到时间 Registration: 2026年12月4日(周五)下午 December 4 (Friday) afternoon, 2026会议时间 Conference:2026年12月5日(周六)- 6日(周日)December 5 (Saturday) – 6 (Sunday), 2026地点 Venue:深圳理工大学天璇楼,广东省深圳市光明区  MERAK Building, Shenzhen University of Advanced Technology (SUAT), Guangming Di