              "snippet": "总览Overview小胶质细胞作为中枢神经系统的固有免疫细胞,在脑发育、稳态维持及神经系统疾病发生中的作用日益受到关注。在前两届成功举办的基础上,“小胶质细胞生理与病理功能专题国际研讨会”已成为汇聚国内外专家学者、推动该领域学术交流与国际合作的重要平台。第三届研讨会将于2026年12月5—6日在深圳理工大学天璇楼召开,本届会议由深圳理工大学Bio-X国际研究院、中国科学院深圳先进技术研究院脑认知与脑疾病研究所联合主办,深圳市脑科学学会承办,中国神经科学学会神经胶质细胞分会协办。届时,国内外相关领域专家学者将再次齐聚,通过学术报告与墙报展示交流前沿研究成果,进一步拓展学术视野,推动小胶质细胞领域的研究合作、基础与临床研究结合及研究成果的转化应用。欢迎全国各高等院校、医院、研究机构和企业的教师、临床医护工作者、科技工作者及各类研究生积极参加。Microglia, the innate immune cells of the central nervous system, are increasingly recognized for their roles in development, homeostasis, and diseases of the brain;Building on the success of  the first two symposia,the International Symposium on the Physiological and Pathological Functions of Microglia has become a key platform for international academic exchange and international collaboration .The 3rd Symposium will take place on December 5–6, 2026, at MERAK Building, Shenzhen University of Advanced Technology. It is jointly hosted by the Bio-X International Institute of Shenzhen University of Advanced Technology and the Brain Cognition and Brain Disease Institute, Shenzhen Institutes of Advanced Technology, Chinese Academy of Sciences, and hosted by theShenzhen Brain Science Society, and co-organized by the Glial Cell Branch of the Chinese Neuroscience Society. The meeting will bring together experts and scholars from China and abroad for academic presentations and poster sessions, fostering the exchange of cutting-edge findings, broader academic perspectives, and closer collaboration across basic, clinical, and translational microglia research.Teachers, clinicians, researchers and graduate students from universities, hospitals, research institutes and enterprises are warmly invited to participate.参会通知:参会通知-第三届小胶质细胞生理与病理功能专题国际研讨会.pdf。(点击下方链接下载参会通知)🔗Notification for Participation in the 3rd International Symposium on the Role of Microglia in Health and Disease01组织机构 Organization主办 Organizer:深圳理工大学Bio-X国际研究院 Bio-X International Institute, Shenzhen University of Advanced T