ion为给参会者提供充分交流最新研究成果的机会,本次会议将设置墙报展示环节。To provide participants with ample opportunities to exchange the latest research findings, this conference will feature a poster session.1)参与方式:请在注册系统提交摘要。How to participate: submit your abstract via the registration system.2)投稿要求:摘要应论点明确、叙述清楚、文字精炼,限500字以内(含题目、作者及单位),英文撰写,文责自负;采用Word格式、单倍行距、12号字、Times New Roman字体;Submission Requirements: Abstracts should be clear, concise and limited to 500 words (including title, authors, and affiliations), submitted in English; authors are responsible for the content. Use Word format, single spacing, 12-point font, Times New Roman.3)摘要投稿截止日期:2026.12.01 Submission deadline: 2026.12.01.4)墙报规格:宽80cm × 高120cm。Poster size: 80 cm (W) × 120 cm (H).07注册费用 Registration Fees在校学生Students300元/人CNY 300 per person非学生参会人员Non-student participants500元/人 CNY 500 per person费用含会务费及餐费;差旅与住宿自理。现场注册须出示有效学生证;博士后、住院医师、实验室技师不按学生身份计收。  The fee covers conference administration and meals; travel and accommodation are at participants’  own expense. Valid student identification must be shown on site; postdocs, residents and laboratory technicians are not eligible for the student rate.扫描注册:会议信息请见会议页面:▼扫码关注公众号回复“M”报名Scan the QR code Reply \"M\" to sign up联系方式:会议秘书处 Secretariat:王一涵 Yihan Wang,wangyh@suat-sz.edu.cn注册报名 Register 徐雅晴 Yaqing Xu 15532451447 ,szbrain@siat.ac.cn08会议住宿与交通 Accommodation and Transportation住宿安排 Accommodation本次会议不统一安排住宿(除受邀参会嘉宾),参会代表请自行联系附近酒店。The conference will not arrange accommodation for attendees (except for invited speakers); participants are advised to contact nearby hotels on their own.交通指引 Transportation:✈️:深圳宝安国际机场:乘地铁11号线(松岗方向)→ 换乘6号线(光明方向)→ 6号线支线至深圳理工大学站。  Shenzhen Bao’an International Airport: Metro Line 11 (towards Songgang) → Line 6 (towards Guangming) → Line 6 Branch to Shenzhen Institute of Technology Station.🚄:光明城高铁站:乘6号线支线直达深圳理工大学站。  Guangmingcheng High-Speed Railway Station: Line 6 Branch directly to Shenzhen Institute of Technology Station.🚄:深圳北站:乘6号线至光明站 → 换乘6号线支线至深圳理工大学站。  Shenzhen 